                                                "example_id": "4ac49104-5e58-43e0-9d54-339275d70acc",
                                                "sense_id": "ae147b0d-be48-378e-b60c-547effed324a",
                                                "text": "[T]hey ſay he has dialogues, and diſcourſes betweene his horſe, himſelfe, and his dogge; […]"
